%% title: Event modeling
%% alt: An event model of an approval: UI, command and event rows from an agent pane through the Inbox to a tool that ran
eventmodeling

tf 01 ui AgentPane
tf 02 cmd RunTool { command: string }
tf 03 evt ApprovalAsked { tool: string }
tf 04 rmo Inbox ->> 03
tf 05 ui InboxPanel
tf 06 cmd Approve { allow: bool }
tf 07 evt ApprovalGranted { by: string }
tf 08 pcr AgentResumer
tf 09 evt ToolRan { exit: int }
